ALTER TABLE "wallets"."sync_runs" RENAME COLUMN "inserted_wtx" TO "inserted_cash_transactions";--> statement-breakpoint
COMMENT ON TABLE "wallets"."sync_runs" IS 'Import sync-run tracking: one row per (user, external_source, spreadsheet_id, sheet). Records a user external spreadsheet import: the source, the spreadsheet/sheet identity, the import progress (last_row), the lifecycle status (pending|running|done|failed), the start/completion timestamps, the error text on a failed run, and the per-run counters - inserted portfolio cash-transaction count (inserted_cash_transactions), inserted portfolio trade-transaction count (inserted_ptx), and skipped-row count (skipped). The purpose lives in this table comment; there is no description data column.';
